[{"id":"CN-HTTP-009","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","Cookie","CORS"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(八)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(八)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/e470b049/"}],"articleIndex":9,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Cookie、同源策略和 CORS 分别解决什么问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>Cookie 管理 HTTP 状态，同源策略限制脚本跨源交互，CORS 让服务端声明哪些跨源浏览器上下文可被允许。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>CORS 不是认证，也不是让所有客户端自动遵守的防火墙。curl 通常不会执行浏览器同源策略，因此 curl 成功不能证明 Fetch 成功。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>浏览器问题需要保留请求上下文：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight http\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"attribute\">Origin\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"punctuation\">: \u003c/span>https://app.example\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"attribute\">Access-Control-Request-Method\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"punctuation\">: \u003c/span>PUT\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"attribute\">Access-Control-Request-Headers\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"punctuation\">: \u003c/span>authorization\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>服务端的许可字段、凭据模式和实际响应读取权限分别决定预检、发送和脚本可见性；curl 成功不等于浏览器上下文也会成功。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-where-to-patch","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["Mock"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(七)隔离环境与测试替身.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(七)隔离环境与测试替身","articlePath":"posts/1d2bf183/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(七)隔离环境与测试替身.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(七)隔离环境与测试替身","articlePath":"posts/1d2bf183/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Mock 为什么要 patch 使用处而不是定义处？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>因为代码运行时按当前模块的名称绑定查找对象，应 patch 被测模块实际读取的名字。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>patch\u003c/code> 要替换的是“被测代码查找的名字”，不是名字最初定义的模块。假设代码这样导入：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\"># service.py\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">from\u003c/span> client \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">import\u003c/span> send\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">notify\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">message\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> send(message)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>此时调用链读取的是 \u003ccode>service.send\u003c/code>，所以应 patch \u003ccode>service.send\u003c/code>；若代码写成 \u003ccode>import client\u003c/code> 后调用 \u003ccode>client.send()\u003c/code>，目标才是 \u003ccode>client.send\u003c/code>。先看导入语句和运行时查找点，再决定 \u003ccode>patch()\u003c/code> 或 \u003ccode>patch.object()\u003c/code> 的目标。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]